# Extracted from res://scripts/combat/combat_arena.gd
# Source material for the rewrite; not loaded by the game.
# Format: story/DIALOGUE_FORMAT.md

~ _start_random_encounter
System: AMBUSH! Enemies are stronger! [%d foes — 1.5x rewards]
System: Enemies appear! [%d foes]

~ _start_boss_fight
SYSTEM: This arena lies silent. The threat has been eliminated.
SYSTEM: %s awakens! Prepare for combat.

~ _on_boss_died
SYSTEM: %s has been defeated!

~ _award_boss_drop
LOOT: Obtained: %s\n%s

~ _show_combat_tutorial
System: WASD/Arrows — Move | SPACE — Jump | J — Attack\nE — Root Access (Hack) | X — Perfect Delete (3 uses)
